Package: Cabix2
Title: A convenient way to create APA styles summaries of descriptives and most used test statistics
Version: 0.1.5
Authors@R: 
    person("Maciej", "Cabanski", ,  "maciej@cabanski.pl", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: The aim of this package is to provide complex, yet easy to use, functions, which come in handy in creating nicely 
    formatted table summaries, more or less similar to those used in APA style articles. The package is adapted to work with 
    datasets imported from SPSS format.
